        2310,
        2077,
        2562
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the New York City Board of Education, by resolution adopted on May 31, 1967, has elected, subject to the approval of the Mayor, to continue such increased-take-home-pay plan during the City's 1967-1968 fiscal year; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
